        "created_at": "2016-08-20T15:39:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just wondering if the Challenges will be updated after OblivAeon is released. With all the added Vengenance style villains and Heroes coming, there is so much more challenges that can be made. I love the added challenges from the Villain ones. There are certain Villains that we never play normal now (like Deadline).</p><p>I would also be interested if there are some more Environment challenges like the ones in the Story Challenge document.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:59.513Z",
